<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>經典背誦報名 - 電視掃描專用</title>
    <!-- 引入 QRCode.js 套件，確保遠距離清晰好掃 -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b5e20 0%, #2e7d32 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 45px 50px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            color: #2c3e50;
            max-width: 500px;
        }
        h1 { margin-top: 0; color: #2e7d32; font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        p { font-size: 18px; color: #546e7a; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        #qrcode {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        #qrcode img {
            padding: 12px;
            background: #fff;
            border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        .tip {
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #78909c;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <h1>📖 時時歡喜・經典背誦報名</h1>
    <p>請打開手機相機，掃描下方二維條碼即可開始報名登記</p>
    
    <div id="qrcode"></div>
    
    <div class="tip">✨ 隨喜發心，培福修慧，與法相伴同行 ✨</div>
</div>

<script>
    // 自動指向您的報名頁面網址
    const targetUrl = "https://stmllg.github.io/learn-5/every_use/sign_up.html";

    // 產生適合電視大銀幕的高畫質 QR Code (尺寸設為 300x300)
    new QRCode(document.getElementById("qrcode"), {
        text: targetUrl,
        width: 300,
        height: 300,
        colorDark: "#000000",
        colorLight: "#ffffff",
        correctLevel: QRCode.CorrectLevel.H
    });
</script>

</body>
</html>
